        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion AS-F3, Tai Chi Lever With Tai Chi Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tai Chi Lever with matching rose is the perfect addition to homes with both an asian motif and also those styled with an island feel. Bamboo symbolizes strength, endurance, and resilience and that is just as well because this Fusion Hardware leverset is backed by a lifetime warranty. Made out of solid brass, it has a medium bronze finish.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/tai-chi-deadbolt-fusion-f3\"><b>Tai Chi Deadbolt</b></a> and<a href=\"/products/tai-chi-knobset-fusion-39-f3\"><b> Tai Chi Knobset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion AS-F3 Tai Chi Lever With Matching Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Tai Chi Lever and Rose Fusion AS F3:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Medium Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tai Chi Leverset, Fusion AS-F3",
                "description": "Tai Chi Lever With Matching Rose Fusion AS-F3 - The Tai Chi Lever with matching rose is the perfect addition to homes with both an asian motif and also those styled with an island feel. Bamboo symbolizes strength, endurance, and resilience and that is just as well because this Fusion Hardware leverset is backed by a lifetime warranty. Made out of solid brass, it has a medium bronze finish. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
